+# TLS Certificate Verification Policy
+
+Certificate verification is required for all builds, including development builds. This decision was recorded as a reversal of an earlier temporary workaround that had disabled certificate verification in development builds, and it establishes that development and production environments must maintain the same TLS security posture.
